cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you cite Mem2A, please cite the specification as below.
type: software
title: "Mem2A: a memory-to-agent protocol"
abstract: >-
  Mem2A is an open protocol, built as an extension of the A2A protocol, that
  lets any AI agent consult a company's shared memory before it acts, hear
  when that changes, and report back after.
authors:
  - name: The Mem2A authors
version: 0.1.0-draft
date-released: 2026-10-01
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://mem2a.github.io/mem2a/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mem2a/mem2a"
keywords:
  - A2A
  - AI agents
  - agent memory
  - protocol
  - specification
